WEBVTT

00:00:10.697 --> 00:00:13.004
Dad.
爸爸

00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:15.310
You don't have to worry
about losing me ever again.
你再也不用担心会失去我了

00:00:16.442 --> 00:00:17.443
Okay?
好吗

00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:28.410
Let me get
some of that.
人家也想抱抱哦

00:00:28.454 --> 00:00:29.611
[LAUGHING]
人家也想抱抱哦

00:00:38.116 --> 00:00:39.987
It's from
the Eastern Province!
是东边来的消息

00:00:41.902 --> 00:00:47.134
Master Lizard, Master Ox,
Master Eagle. All of them.
蜥蜴大师 公牛大师 飞鹰大师 所有人

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:49.475
In every village
from the sea to here...
从海边到内陆的每个村庄

00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:51.781
every master in China...
天底下所有的大师都失踪了

00:00:52.391 --> 00:00:53.566
has vanished.
天底下所有的大师都失踪了

00:00:53.609 --> 00:00:56.134
Maybe they are all at a party.
Monkey.
他们可能集体赴宴去了 认真点

00:00:56.177 --> 00:00:57.483
I didn't get
invited either.
我也没有被邀请啊

00:00:57.526 --> 00:00:59.789
Kai has taken their chi.
是天煞收走了他们的气

00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.531
We are all that stand
between him...
现在一切都只能靠

00:01:02.575 --> 00:01:05.665
and the knowledge
Oogway left in our care.
我们几个乌龟大师的传人了

00:01:06.535 --> 00:01:08.584
The villagers, evacuated?
村民们都疏散了吗 是的 师父

00:01:08.643 --> 00:01:09.973
Done, Master.
村民们都疏散了吗 是的 师父

00:01:10.017 --> 00:01:11.758
SHIFU: Crane, Mantis?
TIGRESS: Still nothing.
仙鹤 螳螂呢 还没消息

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.624
[GASPS] Wait. It's them!
等等 他们来了

00:01:17.546 --> 00:01:18.813
No!
不

00:01:32.779 --> 00:01:34.193
Kai.
天煞

00:01:38.872 --> 00:01:40.047
Nice.
不错嘛

00:01:40.787 --> 00:01:42.387
Very tacky.
真够俗的

00:01:43.616 --> 00:01:45.879
How dare you set foot
on these grounds!
你竟敢踏足这里

00:01:45.922 --> 00:01:48.175
Look at you pathetic fools.
看看你们这群可悲的蠢材

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:52.842
Groveling at the feet
of Oogway the Magnificent.
在伟大的乌龟的脚下卑躬屈膝

00:01:52.886 --> 00:01:55.106
You are not fit
to speak his name.
你没有资格提他的名字

00:01:55.149 --> 00:01:57.592
I am not fit,
little kitten?
我没资格 小猫崽子

00:01:57.847 --> 00:01:59.064
[GROWLS]
我没资格 小猫崽子

00:01:59.545 --> 00:02:02.113
KAI: I fought by his side.
我曾与他并肩作战

00:02:02.156 --> 00:02:04.680
I loved him
like a brother.
把他当成亲兄弟看待

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:08.162
And he betrayed me.
但他却背叛了我

00:02:11.992 --> 00:02:15.169
Now I will destroy
everything he has created!
好吧 现在我要毁掉他亲手创造的一切

00:02:16.736 --> 00:02:18.006
Go!
上

00:02:19.304 --> 00:02:20.566
[YELLING]

00:02:20.609 --> 00:02:22.220
[ALL GRUNTING]

00:02:25.832 --> 00:02:27.335
[GROANS]

00:02:39.715 --> 00:02:41.302
How's that
for a little kitten?
猫崽子还不赖吧

00:02:41.717 --> 00:02:43.348
[SNORTS]

00:02:44.503 --> 00:02:46.190
[GROANS]

00:02:49.072 --> 00:02:50.436
[GRUNTS]

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.250
[SCREAMS]

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.219
[GASPS]

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:00.649
[GRUNTS] I will not let you
destroy Oogway's memory.
我绝不允许你毁掉乌龟建立的一切

00:03:00.693 --> 00:03:02.956
Why not?
He destroyed mine.
凭什么 他毁了我的一切

00:03:02.999 --> 00:03:04.175
MONKEY: Mantis.
螳螂 是我呀 你的铁哥们

00:03:04.218 --> 00:03:06.493
It is me, your bestie!
螳螂 是我呀 你的铁哥们

00:03:07.656 --> 00:03:08.788
[GROANING]

00:03:11.878 --> 00:03:13.009
Sorry, Tigress!
[GROANS]
对不起 娇虎 对不起

00:03:13.053 --> 00:03:15.577
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!
对不起 对不起 哦 对不起

00:03:15.621 --> 00:03:17.091
Sorry!
对不起 对不起 哦 对不起

00:03:27.546 --> 00:03:29.050
[GROANING]

00:03:30.549 --> 00:03:31.879
Shifu.
师父

00:03:32.028 --> 00:03:33.750
Bring them to me.
把他们带过来

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.336
[SCREAMING]

00:03:42.082 --> 00:03:43.301
[LAUGHING]

00:03:43.692 --> 00:03:44.911
No.
不 通知阿宝要紧

00:03:44.954 --> 00:03:46.086
You must warn Po.
不 通知阿宝要紧

00:03:46.129 --> 00:03:47.389
Master, please.
那你吶 师父

00:03:47.435 --> 00:03:48.610
[GROANING]

00:03:55.878 --> 00:03:59.186
I will show you the true
power of chi, brother.
我来让你尝尝气的真正威力 老兄

00:03:59.621 --> 00:04:00.796
[GRUNTS]
我来让你尝尝气的真正威力 老兄

00:04:01.623 --> 00:04:02.994
No.
不

